Administrasi.
Chizhou mengelola 1 distrik dan 3 county:
<ul>
<li>Distrik Guichi ()</li>
<li>County Dongzhi ()</li>
<li>County Shitai ()</li>
<li>County Qingyang ()</li>
</ul>
